-expected-diags-2 string()
	quote
		test:///a.crow 2:5-2:8 This is part of a circular import:
			test:///a.crow imports
			test:///b.crow imports
			test:///a.crow
		test:///b.crow 2:5-2:8 This is part of a circular import:
			test:///b.crow imports
			test:///a.crow imports
			test:///b.crow
